# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  TexLab
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  What this repo is for: the NoiseBaker plugin source, and the recipe assets
#  that describe every bake. Not the bakes themselves.
#
#  A 256^3 BGRA8 volume is 64 MB and noise is near-incompressible, so nothing
#  shrinks in a repo and every re-bake writes a fresh 64 MB blob that history
#  keeps forever. The recipes are a few KB each and fully determine their
#  output, so tracking those and regenerating on demand costs nothing and loses
#  nothing.
#
#  This only works if baked textures and recipes live in separate folders.
#  Set each recipe's TargetPackagePath to /Game/Noise/Textures and keep the
#  recipe assets themselves in /Game/Noise/Recipes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Baked output. Regenerate with the recipe's Bake button.
Content/Noise/Textures/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Unreal build artefacts
#
#  No leading slash, so these match at any depth and cover the plugin's own
#  Binaries and Intermediate folders as well as the project's.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/
# Baked output. Regenerate from the recipes in Content/NoiseRecipes.
Content/Noise/
Plugins/VolumeNoiseLib/Content

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Generated project files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Compiled binaries
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*.dll
*.exe
*.lib
*.pdb
*.so
*.dylib
*.a

